# Freeze bytes as committed: no EOL conversion on checkout/checkin, ever.
# This repo deliberately mixes styles — upstream files are CRLF (+BOM),
# fork-added files are LF — and the instanced-renderer audit traced its
# biggest merge-friction item to tooling silently flipping the old files
# (8 core files were LF-flipped once; renormalized 2026-08-08). Tools that
# rewrite whole files must preserve the file's existing style byte-for-byte
# (AGENTS.md pitfall 12).
* -text
